<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1920696506"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1610113154"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="幽世に舞え (feat. Sennzai)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="雄之助 / Sennzai"/><amll:meta key="album" value="幽世に舞え (feat. Sennzai)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:08.597"><div begin="00:00.199" end="03:08.597"><p begin="00:00.199" end="00:08.726" itunes:key="L1">灯 掬いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">掬起一捧光点</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to mo shi bi su ku i te</span></p><p begin="00:08.727" end="00:15.210" itunes:key="L2">露命は燃ゆる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">燃烧刹那生命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ro me i wa mo yu ru</span></p><p begin="00:15.679" end="00:19.190" itunes:key="L3">可惜夜あとに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于深夜里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta ra yo a to ni</span></p><p begin="00:19.191" end="00:22.963" itunes:key="L4">翅はためいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">惋惜地挥动羽翼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ne ha ta me i te</span></p><p begin="00:22.964" end="01:15.887" itunes:key="L5">幽世に舞え<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">幽幽世间翩然起舞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ku ri yo ni ma e</span></p><p begin="01:34.805" end="01:42.963" itunes:key="L6">夜明けの 華は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">破晓时分的花朵</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo a ke no ha na wa</span></p><p begin="01:42.964" end="01:48.797" itunes:key="L7">誘いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">引人入迷</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i za na i te</span></p><p begin="01:49.484" end="01:53.117" itunes:key="L8">未だ見ぬ 境へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走向前所未见之境</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da mi nu kyo u he</span></p><p begin="01:53.118" end="01:56.722" itunes:key="L9">この身を変え<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">幻化自身形态</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no mi wo ka e</span></p><p begin="01:56.723" end="03:08.597" itunes:key="L10">幽世に舞え<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">幽幽世间翩然起舞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ku ri yo ni ma e</span></p></div></body></tt>